{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的S13把想要确定承诺却明知无法保证的心理，改写成了‘就算听到了，越喜欢跟他待着，时间越过得快’，因果关系不够清楚；S07的‘对生命的眷恋’也略显突兀。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把长叙述拆成短句，并用加亮关键词建立视觉落点，普通观众更容易在听音乐时抓住每段发生了什么、情绪在哪里转弯；感受词按音乐进程出现，也减少了一次性阅读的负担。反复出现的水波、小船、漂浮、靠岸等意象，让音乐感受与人物心境形成了连续的联系，细腻程度也明显更高。X的优势是完整叙述对人物动机和心理因果交代得更稳，尤其部分复杂转折比Y更准确，但整体上Y更容易让观众边听边进入这段情绪经历。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "9caa5918-3a1f-4e87-b57b-294a9f1ba1f8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193221282882Z", "elapsed_seconds": 104.828, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:34:06.115195+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "25266e914cc9dff1abc6e60935ab97e8403b7d778e685d737312b69670447ac4", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc42223